; An after-thunk that pauses while exit leaves its task runs to its end
; before any module unloads: the exit waits for the task to end.
> (import (user))
> (dynamic-wind void (lambda () (exit)) (lambda () (timers:sleep 0.1) (user:say-leaving)))
leaving the task
configuration unloading
user unloading
keeper unloading
> (display "never runs")
